{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2023a.q27.material.recovered", "text": "材料：“检测生物组织中的糖类”实验是“分子与细胞”模块中一个比较基础的验证性实验。查阅文献可以发现，许多教师在实验材料、实验方法等方面进行了以下优化改进，且实验效果良好。（1）教材中实验材料选用苹果匀浆、梨匀浆，有的老师利用葡萄、白萝卜代替。（2）在实验方法上，将装有检测试剂的试管，放入盛有50～65°C温水的烧杯中加热约2min；有的老师选择使用斐林试剂的改良试剂——本尼迪特试剂；而加热的方法就更多样了，电磁炉加热、80～90°C热水浴加热、将试管直接在酒精灯上加热等。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "61a3fc8aba6d6df85ac9d9042e8f66b2748ec2ab9fcb56abbce7d4b8d221136b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3903, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4141, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "61a3fc8aba6d6df85ac9d9042e8f66b2748ec2ab9fcb56abbce7d4b8d221136b"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2023a.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k10", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s4.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.408.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2023a.q27"], "word_count": 238, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "shengwu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "61a3fc8aba6d6df85ac9d9042e8f66b2748ec2ab9fcb56abbce7d4b8d221136b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3903, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4141, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中