{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2023a.q28.material.recovered", "text": "材料：某教师在讲解基因表达时，对学生的学情分析为：学生在学习第3章“基因的本质”后，对基因有了初步的认知和浓厚的学习兴趣，而第4章“基因的表达”内容不仅抽象复杂，而且涉及的物质种类也比较多，因此学生往往会陷入“学习时都懂，学习后不会”的状态，本节内容宜通过建模教学展现转录和翻译的步骤，充分调动学生学习的主动性，切实培养学生的能力，注意避免烦琐的讲解。该教师在教学中，利用细铁丝、卡纸、磁条、彩色磁片等物品制作教具，并和同学们共同利用该模型模拟了“遗传信息的翻译”过程，使学生清晰明了地掌握知识。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "61a3fc8aba6d6df85ac9d9042e8f66b2748ec2ab9fcb56abbce7d4b8d221136b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4200, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4448, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "61a3fc8aba6d6df85ac9d9042e8f66b2748ec2ab9fcb56abbce7d4b8d221136b"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2023a.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k04", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k09", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s3.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.408.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2023a.q28"], "word_count": 248, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "shengwu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "61a3fc8aba6d6df85ac9d9042e8f66b2748ec2ab9fcb56abbce7d4b8d221136b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4200, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4448, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role"